9d57ceee9993a2.m4a", "recited": null, "recitedText": null}, {"tense": "imperative", "pronoun": "anti", "arabic": "اِعْجَبِي", "plain": "اِعْجَبِي", "quran": false, "notUsed": false, "spoken": "audio/60ebcd9900995f647921.m4a", "recited": null, "recitedText": null}, {"tense": "imperative", "pronoun": "antuma", "arabic": "اِعْجَبَا", "plain": "اِعْجَبَا", "quran": false, "notUsed": false, "spoken": "audio/0864f553f3afb8cbf2b2.m4a", "recited": null, "recitedText": null}, {"tense": "imperative", "pronoun": "antum", "arabic": "اِعْجَبُوا", "plain": "اِعْجَبُوا", "quran": false, "notUsed": false, "spoken": "audio/a866ad0acf477897bfe8.m4a", "recited": null, "recitedText": null}, {"tense": "imperative", "pronoun": "antunna", "arabic": "اِعْجَبْنَ", "plain": "اِعْجَبْنَ", "quran": false, "notUsed": false, "spoken": "audio/359f4bdd7df230d00844.m4a", "recited": null, "recitedText": null}], "ayat": [{"ref": "38:4", "tense": "past", "category": {"tense": "past", "pronoun": "hum", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/3974.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "And they marvel that a warner from among themselves hath come unto them, and the disbelievers say: This is a wizard, a charlatan.", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "İçlerinden kendilerine uyarıcı bir peygamber geldiğine şaştılar da kâfirler: \"Bu bir sihirbazdır, yalancıdır\" dediler.", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "اور انہیں اس کا اچنبھا ہوا کہ ان کے پاس انہیں میں کا ایک ڈر سنانے والا تشریف لایا اور کافر بولے یہ جادوگر ہے بڑا جھوٹا،", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "Dan mereka heran karena mereka kedatangan seorang pemberi peringatan (rasul) dari kalangan mereka; dan orang-orang kafir berkata: \"Ini adalah seorang ahli sihir yang banyak berdusta\".", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "وَعَجِبُوٓا۟", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/f6b474fac15928ba53cb.m4a", "gloss": {"en": "and they were amazed", "bs": "i začudili su se", "tr": "ve şaşırdılar", "fr": "et ils se sont émerveillés", "id": "dan mereka terheran-heran", "ur": "اور وہ تعجب کرنے لگے", "bn": "এবং তারা বিস্মিত হলো", "fa": "و شگفت‌زده شدند"}}, {"text": "أَن", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "جَآءَهُم", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "مُّنذِرٌ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "مِّنْهُمْ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "وَقَالَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ٱلْكَٰفِرُونَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "هَٰذَا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "سَٰحِرٌ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "كَذَّابٌ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}, {"ref": "37:12", "tense": "past", "category": {"tense": "past", "pronoun": "anta", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/3800.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "Nay, but thou dost marvel when they mock", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "Fakat sen onlara şaşıyorsun, ama onlar (seninle) eğleniyorlar.", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "بلکہ تمہیں اچنبھا آیا اور وہ ہنسی کرتے ہیں", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "Bahkan kamu menjadi heran (terhadap keingkaran mereka) dan mereka menghinakan kamu.", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "بَلْ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "عَجِبْتَ", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/9d2a73df93e58b0900e1.m4a", "gloss": {"bs": "začudio si se", "en": "you wondered", "tr": "şaşırdın", "fr": "tu t'es étonné", "id": "engkau takjub", "ur": "تم نے تعجب کیا", "bn": "তুমি বিস্মিত হয়েছ", "fa": "تعجب کردی"}}, {"text": "وَيَسْخَرُونَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}, {"ref": "53:59", "tense": "present", "category": {"tense": "present", "pronoun": "antum", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/4843.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "Marvel ye then at this statement,", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "Şimdi siz bu sözden mi hayret ediyorsunuz?", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "تو کیا اس بات سے تم تعجب کرتے ہو", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "Maka apakah kamu merasa heran terhadap pemberitaan ini?", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "أَفَمِنْ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "هَٰذَا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ٱلْحَدِيثِ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "تَعْجَبُونَ", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/d831738b7164ae433f99.m4a", "gloss": {"bs": "čudite se", "en": "you wonder", "tr": "şaşırıyorsunuz", "fr": "vous vous étonnez", "id": "kalian heran", "ur": "تم تعجب کرتے ہو", "bn": "তোমরা বিস্মিত হও", "fa": "شما تعجب می‌کنید"}}]}], "forms": [{"arabic": "أَوَعَجِبْتُمْ", "count": 2, "first": "7:63", "audio": "audio/740bf857dd345faee8c1.m4a", "grammar": [{"tense": "past", "pronoun": "antum", "passive": false, "objects": []}]}, {"arabic": "أَتَعْجَبِينَ", "count": 1, "first": "11:73", "audio": "audio/8498464d5844db36b988.m4a", "grammar": [{"tense": "present", "pronoun": "anti", "passive": false, "objects": [], "mood": "indicative"}], "gloss": {"en": "are you amazed?", "bs": "zar se čudiš?", "tr": "şaşırıyor musun?", "fr": "t'émerveilles-tu ?", "id": "apakah kamu terheran-heran?", "ur": "کیا تم تعجب کرتے ہو؟", "bn": "তুমি কি বিস্মিত?", "fa": "آیا شگفت‌زده می‌شوی؟"}}, {"arabic": "تَعْجَبْ", "count": 1, "first": "13:5", "audio": "audio/d7c6ada80aeda72e486f.m4a", "grammar": [{"tense": "present", "pronoun": "anta", "passive": false, "objects": [], "mood": "jussive"}]}, {"arabic": "عَجِبْتَ", "count": 1, "f